,"Tada kelią jau žinote.","Taip, prašau.","Ar galiu užlipti?","Taip, žinoma. Lipkite lėtai: laiptai aukšti.","Gal galėtumėte pakartoti?","Be abejo.","Ar čia yra iguanų?","Daug. Jos – šios vietos šeimininkės.","Žinoma!","Kiek šventyklai metų?","Jai apie aštuonis šimtus metų.","Ne, man ir taip gerai, ačiū.","Žinoma, ačiū!","Jokių problemų."],"turns":[[0,"¡Buenas tardes! Pase, por favor.","Good afternoon! Come in, please.","e6f93f6aac48",2.7],[0,"¿Es su primera vez aquí?","Is it your first time here?","ab36d3bad4fe",1.85],[-1,"Sí, es mi primera vez.","Yes, it's my first time.",1],[0,"¡Qué bueno! Le va a gustar.","How nice! You're going to like it.","87b2f3dabae7",2.25],[0,"La entrada es gratis.","Entry is free.","26e23563a5bd",1.62],[0,"Puede subir al templo, pero con cuidado.","You can go up to the temple, but be careful.","9bd08e668bdd",3.39],[0,"¿Tiene alguna pregunta?","Do you have any questions?","465f1cb6cca0",1.73],[-1,"¡Sería genial, gracias!","That would be great, thanks!",1],[-1,"No, gracias.","No, thanks.",1],[0,"Muy bien. Adelante, entonces.","All right. Go ahead, then.","37be58519538",2.88],[0,"Disfrute su visita.","Enjoy your visit.","6a299f21fd8e",1.64],[0,"¡Buenas tardes otra vez! Pase, pase.","Good afternoon again! Come in, come in.","fb8f1d4d6d16",3.25],[-1,"Perdón, no escuché bien.","Sorry, I didn't catch that.",1],[-1,"¿Cómo se llama el templo?","What is the temple called?",1],[0,"Se llama el Templo del Mar.","It's called the Temple of the Sea.","2020cdcfe743",3.25],[0,"Mira al mar desde siempre.","It has always looked out to sea.","2da05b917048",2.99],[-1,"No, ya conozco las ruinas.","No, I already know the ruins.",1],[0,"Entonces ya conoce el camino.","Then you already know the way.","8023117bfc4f",2.93],[-1,"Sí, por favor.","Yes, please.",1],[-1,"¿Puedo subir?","Can I go up?",1],[0,"Sí, claro. Suba despacio: los escalones son altos.","Yes, of course. Go up slowly: the steps are high.","07523b4f6b72",4.21],[-1,"¿Me lo repite, por favor?","Could yo